OL,3,GNEWSAGlobal Microsoft outage hits
OL,4,Aschools, doctors and businesses as
OL,5,Acompany scrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA GP tells our correspondent "there
OL,8,Fwill be major problems NHS-wise";
OL,9,Fschools are reporting issues and ask
OL,10,Fparents to get in touch via phone not
OL,11,Femail; UK Parliament says "alternative
OL,12,Fcommunication arrangements are in
OL,13,Fplace"
OL,15,FHow are you affected? Georgia, from
OL,16,FStaffordshire, says the outage has
OL,17,Fdelayed the completion of her first
OL,18,Fhouse purchase. Meanwhile, Martin says
OL,19,Fit was "bliss" to wake up to no emails
OL,20,F- before he realised "today is a
OL,21,Fcrucial day to conclude a business
OL,22,Fdeal"
